pan><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"usual uniform reflection variant; Notes"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52,61"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63,72"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"通常版本的图公式展开已检查；原书只说明与其代码版本在 PA 上差别可忽略，未在本条证明全套等价"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的标准证明表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))\">\\(\\vec x=\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\vec x}\">\\(b_{\\vec x}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a>，包括非法码默认值和数词代入约定。</li>\n<li>对每个固定的变量表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{s,\\vec x}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{1+|\\vec x|}\">\\(e_{s,\\vec x}\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_{1+|\\vec x|}\\)</span> 是下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{g,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N^{1+|\\vec x|}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s_{g,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N^{1+|\\vec x|}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的程序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_{s,\\vec x}⟧=s_{g,\\vec x}\">\\(⟦ e_{s,\\vec x}⟧=s_{g,\\vec x}\\)</span>；图公式使用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\gamma\">\\(D,\\gamma\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,w,\\vec y\">\\(z,w,\\vec y\\)</span> 是所需的互异新鲜变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UInst}\">\\(\\mathrm{UInst}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns_{g,\\vec x}(n,\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(n,b_{\\vec x},\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}(z,\\vec y,w)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{s,\\vec x}}(z,\\vec y,w),\\\\\n\\mathrm{UInst}_{T,\\vec x}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\\forall w\\,\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\vec x,w)\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(w)\\to\\varphi)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UInst}_{T,\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))}(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns_{g,\\vec x}(n,\\vec a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(n,b_{\\vec x},\\operatorname{enc}(\\vec a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}(z,\\vec y,w)&amp;\\coloneqq D_{e_{s,\\vec x}}(z,\\vec y,w),\\\\\n\\mathrm{UInst}_{T,\\vec x}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\\forall w\\,\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Sub}_{g,\\vec x}(\\overline{g(\\varphi)},\\vec x,w)\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(w)\\to\\varphi)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathcal C}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathrm{UInst}_{T,\\operatorname{VList}(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi))}(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留通常按公式参数逐一反思的接口，并把旧稿“带点变元的 Gödel 编码”展开成对象语言图公式，避免在对象量词下偷偷做元语言数词代入。PA 中图的唯一全函数性保证它与常用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi(\\vec x))\">\\(\\forall\\vec x(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi(\\dot{\\vec x})\\urcorner)\\to\\varphi(\\vec x))\\)</span> 记法相应。</p>\n<p>原书第 52 页实际定义的是按复杂度类的代码／部分真定义反思；第 61 页注释明确提醒该 RFN 与通常称作 uniform reflection 的版本不完全一样，在含 PA 的理论中差别可忽略。因此本条注明是通常版本的形式展开，原书的实际代码版本另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4837cec0530b35f0\" href=\"?note=4837cec0530b35f0\" title=\"67-df-uniform-reflection\">67-df-uniform-reflection</a>；不把两套句子集合宣称逐字相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 固定 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的标准证明表示；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 取 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 固定 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的标准证明表示；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 取 [[67-df-provability-predicate]]。$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf